          <head n="2" source="#source-226636-226738"><seg source="#source-226657-226663">民俗</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-226663-226708" corresp="#source-226672-226708"><seg source="#source-226663-226672">（２）</seg></hi></head>
